## AI agent guidelines

Library: `docs/ai-agent-guidelines/` (see its `README.md` index).

- Always skim `docs/ai-agent-guidelines/ai/constitution.md`
- Docs / openings → `docs/ai-agent-guidelines/ai/tech-writing.md`
- Code → `docs/ai-agent-guidelines/ai/coding.md`
- Known pitfalls → `docs/ai-agent-guidelines/ai/pitfalls/` (e.g. react-effect-tabs, i18n-csv-only)

Load only the file for the current task; run that file's checklist before finishing.
